{"id":43088,"ord":127,"n_segments":151,"prev":43087,"next":43089,"doc":{"id":"52157","title":"52157_Count Basie oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Count Basie","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/52157/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=52157"},"chapter":"Carnegie Hall, nicknames and later career","title":"Band nicknames: Holy, Cat Eye, Sweets","category":"person_portrait","summary":"Basie answers who named Sweets Edison, and about Lester's naming of band members.","period":"1930s-40s","year_from":1930,"year_to":1979,"words":137,"start":[216,2],"end":[217,4],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=52157#s43088","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Count Basie Orchestra","focus":0,"leader":"Count Basie"}]},"people":[{"name":"Lester Young","qid":"Q110714","n":3},{"name":"Harry Edison","qid":"Q289821","n":3},{"name":"Buck Clayton","qid":"Q999321","n":2},{"name":"Dickie Wells","qid":"Q350879","n":1},{"name":"Freddie Green","qid":"Q722441","n":1}],"story":{"theme":31,"theme_name":"How I got my name: nicknames and band monikers","community":56,"community_name":"How I got my name: nicknames and band names","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":216,"b":2,"s":"MS.","x":"She had special material, I guess. How about -- okay, who -- Lester named you \"The Main\"?"},{"p":216,"b":3,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"What?"},{"p":216,"b":4,"s":"MS.","x":"Lester named you \"The Main\"?"},{"p":216,"b":5,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"The what?"},{"p":216,"b":6,"s":"MS.","x":"The Main. The Holy Main or \"The Main\"?"},{"p":216,"b":7,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":216,"b":8,"s":"MS.","x":"Which one? Holy?"},{"p":216,"b":9,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":216,"b":10,"s":"MS.","x":"And why was Buck Clayton \"Cat Eye\"?"},{"p":216,"b":11,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Oh, I don't know; (unintelligible) name."},{"p":216,"b":12,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah. Who gave \"Sweets\" his name?"},{"p":216,"b":13,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"I think Sweets gave himself that name. (Unintelligible)"},{"p":216,"b":14,"s":"","x":"(Laughter)"},{"p":216,"b":15,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Yeah, I think he named himself."},{"p":216,"b":16,"s":"MS.","x":"I think he named himself, too. I mean Lester didn't name him; Sweets named himself. Did you call Buck \"Cat Eye\" or did Sweets call him Cat Eye? Did everybody --"},{"p":216,"b":17,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"(Unintelligible) the band."},{"p":216,"b":18,"s":"MS.","x":"Why was Freddy Green (unintelligible)?"},{"p":217,"b":0,"s":"MS.","x":"whether Dickie Wells. Somebody gave him that nickname. Do you think Dickie did?"},{"p":217,"b":1,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"I don't know. (Inaudible)"},{"p":217,"b":2,"s":"MS.","x":"Why do you think? (Unintelligible)"},{"p":217,"b":3,"s":"","x":"I don't know"},{"p":217,"b":4,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"(Inaudible)"}]}